error[E0610]: the error-set alias `E` names itself
 --> mem:///main.lu:1:12
  |
1 | error E = {E}
  |            ^ this alias expands to itself
  |
  = note: the loop is E -> E — an alias is a spelling for a set of tags, so the set has to be
    writable without it ([type.err.alias.cycle]). Name tags, or a shorter alias.
